## Portable project hub

When `.specweave/project/hub.json` exists, read its goal and shared context before starting work. `specweave project show` lists current work, artifacts and routine definitions; `specweave project brief --harness codex` exports a fresh assignment. Use native skills/task tools when available and authorized, or execute sequentially. Routines are definitions until configured in a native scheduler.
